#: alarmmanager_admin.php:50
msgid "The administration action succeeded."
msgstr "Falka maamulku wuu guuleystay."

#: alarmmanager_admin.php:86
msgid "Administration unavailable or permission denied."
msgstr "Maamulka lama heli karo ama ogolaanshaha waa la diiday."

#: includes/admin_view.php:78
msgid "Choose the alarm information to send to any service. Use Combined text to arrange device details, or Use device message to start with a complete message. Email uses Subject and Message; API destinations use the field names required by the receiving service."
msgstr "Dooro macluumaadka qaylo-dhaanta ee loo dirayo adeeg kasta. Isticmaal Qoraal isku-dhafan si aad u habeeyso faahfaahinta qalabka, ama Isticmaal fariinta qalabka si aad ugu bilowdo fariin dhammaystiran. Iimaylku wuxuu isticmaalaa Mawduuca iyo Fariinta; meelaha loo dirayo ee API waxay isticmaalaan magacyada meelaha uu u baahan yahay adeegga helaya."

#: includes/admin_view.php:79
msgid "Advanced message configuration"
msgstr "Habaynta horumarsan ee fariinta"

#: includes/admin_view.php:90
msgid "New endpoint"
msgstr "Bar-dhammaad cusub"

#: includes/admin_view.php:100
msgid "Custom integration"
msgstr "Isdhexgal gaar ah"

#: includes/admin_view.php:100
msgid "Integration provider"
msgstr "Bixiyaha isdhexgalka"

#: includes/admin_view.php:112
msgid "API Key SID and Secret (recommended)"
msgstr "API Key SID iyo Sir (la taliyay)"

#: includes/admin_view.php:112
msgid "Account SID and Auth Token"
msgstr "Account SID iyo Token-ka Xaqiijinta"

#: includes/admin_view.php:112
msgid "Twilio credentials"
msgstr "Aqoonsiyada Twilio"

#: includes/admin_view.php:113
msgid "Send using"
msgstr "Ku dir adigoo isticmaalaya"

#: includes/admin_view.php:125
msgid "Event"
msgstr "Dhacdo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:125
msgid "Incident"
msgstr "Shil"

#: includes/admin_view.php:125
msgid "ServiceNow record type"
msgstr "Nooca diiwaanka ServiceNow"

#: includes/admin_view.php:126
msgid "Changing the record type replaces the destination table, message fields and recovery settings with its defaults. Your instance and credentials are retained."
msgstr "Beddelidda nooca diiwaanka waxay ku beddeshaa shaxda meesha loo dirayo, meelaha fariinta iyo dejinta soo-kabashada kuwa caadiga ah. Tusaalahaaga iyo aqoonsiyadaadu way sii jirayaan."

#: includes/admin_view.php:149
msgid "Destination"
msgstr "Ujeeddada"

#: includes/admin_view.php:154
msgid "Email settings"
msgstr "Dejinta iimaylka"

#: includes/admin_view.php:161
msgid "Delivery uses the Cacti mail settings. Add the people who should receive these alarms."
msgstr "Gaarsiintu waxay isticmaashaa dejinta iimaylka ee Cacti. Ku dar dadka heli doona qaylo-dhaannadan."

#: includes/admin_view.php:162
msgid "Script settings"
msgstr "Dejinta qoraalka"

#: includes/admin_view.php:167
msgid "JSON output is sent to the script on standard input."
msgstr "Soo-saarka JSON waxaa qoraalka loogu diraa gelinta caadiga ah."

#: includes/admin_view.php:167
msgid "The executable must exist and be executable by the worker on every delivering poller. Arguments are passed directly without a shell."
msgstr "Barnaamijka la fulin karo waa inuu jiraa oo uu fulin karaa hawl-wadeenku poller kasta oo gaarsiinaya. Doodaha waxaa si toos ah loo gudbiyaa iyadoo aan la isticmaalin shell."

#: includes/admin_view.php:169
msgid "WebSocket delivery is not implemented."
msgstr "Gaarsiinta WebSocket lama hirgelin."

#: includes/admin_view.php:171
msgid "Advanced delivery settings"
msgstr "Dejinta horumarsan ee gaarsiinta"

#: includes/admin_view.php:176
msgid "Connection options"
msgstr "Ikhtiyaarrada isku-xirka"

#: includes/admin_view.php:179
msgid "Method"
msgstr "Habka"

#: includes/admin_view.php:186
msgid "Certificate and hostname verification remain enabled. Provision the PEM file on every poller. Saved credentials are never displayed."
msgstr "Xaqiijinta shahaadada iyo magaca martigeliyaha way shidan tahay. Ku diyaari faylka PEM poller kasta. Aqoonsiyada kaydsan marna lama soo bandhigo."

#: includes/admin_view.php:187
msgid "Other delivery options"
msgstr "Ikhtiyaarrada kale ee gaarsiinta"

#: includes/admin_view.php:189 includes/admin_view.php:458
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Jooji"

#: includes/admin_view.php:189
msgid "Test destination saves the current settings and queues a sample alarm for this destination. Enable the destination before testing."
msgstr "Tijaabi meesha loo dirayo waxay kaydisaa dejinta hadda waxayna safka gelisaa qaylo-dhaan tusaale ah meeshan. Daar meesha loo dirayo ka hor tijaabinta."

#: includes/admin_view.php:190
msgid "Save endpoint"
msgstr "Kaydi bar-dhammaadka"

#: includes/admin_view.php:190
msgid "Test destination"
msgstr "Tijaabi meesha loo dirayo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:194
msgid "Delete endpoint"
msgstr "Tirtir bar-dhammaadka"

#: includes/admin_view.php:194
msgid "Delete this endpoint, its delivery settings and saved credentials"
msgstr "Tirtir bar-dhammaadkan, dejintiisa gaarsiinta iyo aqoonsiyada kaydsan"

#: includes/admin_view.php:194
msgid "Deleting stops future delivery and removes the saved settings and credentials. Remove notification rule references and resolve queued or running deliveries first. Completed and failed delivery history is preserved."
msgstr "Tirtiriddu waxay joojisaa gaarsiinta mustaqbalka waxayna ka saartaa dejinta iyo aqoonsiyada kaydsan. Marka hore ka saar tixraacyada xeerka ogeysiiska oo xalli gaarsiinta safka ku jirta ama socota. Taariikhda gaarsiinta dhammaatay iyo tan fashilantay waa la ilaaliyaa."

#: includes/admin_view.php:205
msgid "Chat and messaging"
msgstr "Sheekaysiga iyo fariimaha"

#: includes/admin_view.php:206
msgid "Post alarms to a Slack channel."
msgstr "U dir qaylo-dhaannada kanaalka Slack."

#: includes/admin_view.php:207
msgid "Post alarm cards through a Teams Workflow."
msgstr "U dir kaararka qaylo-dhaanta iyadoo loo marayo Teams Workflow."

#: includes/admin_view.php:208
msgid "Send alarms from a Telegram bot."
msgstr "Ka dir qaylo-dhaanno bot-ka Telegram."

#: includes/admin_view.php:209
msgid "Text alarms to phone numbers."
msgstr "U dir qaylo-dhaanno qoraal ah lambarrada telefoonka."

#: includes/admin_view.php:210
msgid "Send approved WhatsApp templates."
msgstr "Dir qaab-dhismeedyada WhatsApp ee la ansixiyay."

#: includes/admin_view.php:211
msgid "Incident management"
msgstr "Maaraynta shilalka"

#: includes/admin_view.php:212
msgid "Trigger and resolve PagerDuty incidents."
msgstr "Kici oo xalli shilalka PagerDuty."

#: includes/admin_view.php:213
msgid "Open and resolve ServiceNow incidents or events."
msgstr "Fur oo xalli shilalka ama dhacdooyinka ServiceNow."

#: includes/admin_view.php:214
msgid "Network management"
msgstr "Maamulka shabakadda"

#: includes/admin_view.php:215
msgid "Send SNMPv2c or SNMPv3 traps and INFORMs."
msgstr "Dir dabinnada SNMPv2c ama SNMPv3 iyo INFORM-yada."

#: includes/admin_view.php:216
msgid "Forward RFC 5424 or RFC 3164 messages over UDP, TCP or TLS."
msgstr "U gudbi fariimaha RFC 5424 ama RFC 3164 iyadoo la adeegsanayo UDP, TCP ama TLS."

#: includes/admin_view.php:217
msgid "Custom"
msgstr "Gaar ah"

#: includes/admin_view.php:218
msgid "Start from an empty endpoint."
msgstr "Ka bilow bar-dhammaad madhan."

#: includes/admin_view.php:219
msgid "POST alarm JSON to any HTTPS endpoint."
msgstr "U dir JSON qaylo-dhaan adigoo isticmaalaya POST bar-dhammaad kasta oo HTTPS ah."

#: includes/admin_view.php:220
msgid "Call an API with your own method, authentication and response checks."
msgstr "U wac API adigoo isticmaalaya habkaaga, xaqiijintaada iyo hubinta jawaabahaaga."

#: includes/admin_view.php:221
msgid "Run a local executable with the alarm as JSON input."
msgstr "Ku orod barnaamij maxalli ah iyadoo qaylo-dhaantu tahay gelinta JSON."

#: includes/admin_view.php:227
msgid "Add integration"
msgstr "Ku dar isdhexgal"

#: includes/admin_view.php:228
msgid "Choose a template. It opens as a disabled draft; nothing is sent until you enable it."
msgstr "Dooro qaab-dhismeed. Wuxuu u furmaa sidii qabyo damisan; waxba lama diro ilaa aad shiddo."

#: includes/admin_view.php:228
msgid "Search integrations"
msgstr "Raadi isdhexgallada"

#: includes/admin_view.php:234
msgid "Blank endpoint"
msgstr "Bar-dhammaad madhan"

#: includes/admin_view.php:239
msgid "No integrations match your search."
msgstr "Ma jiraan isdhexgallo u dhigma raadintaada."

#: includes/admin_view.php:243
msgid "SNMP trap settings"
msgstr "Dejinta dabinka SNMP"

#: includes/admin_view.php:259
msgid "Saved community and passphrases are encrypted and never displayed. Leave them blank to keep the saved values; entering any value replaces all saved SNMP secrets."
msgstr "Bulshada iyo weedhaha sirta ee kaydsan waa la sir-qariyay marna lama soo bandhigo. Madhan u daa si aad u hayso qiimayaasha kaydsan; gelinta qiimo kasta waxay beddeshaa dhammaan siraha SNMP ee kaydsan."

#: includes/admin_view.php:260
msgid "Traps are sent as Cacti's CACTI-MIB cactiNotify with the snmptrap binary from Cacti Settings > Paths on every delivering poller. Add one destination per receiver."
msgstr "Dabinnada waxaa loo diraa sidii CACTI-MIB cactiNotify ee Cacti iyadoo la adeegsanayo faylka snmptrap ee Dejinta Cacti > Waddooyinka poller kasta oo gaarsiinaya. Ku dar hal meel loo diro qaataha kasta."

#: includes/admin_view.php:261
msgid "Syslog settings"
msgstr "Dejinta Syslog"

#: includes/admin_view.php:269
msgid "TLS verifies the receiver certificate and hostname. Use port 6514 for TLS. UDP and TCP are unencrypted, and a UDP message is confirmed only as sent."
msgstr "TLS waxay xaqiijisaa shahaadada qaataha iyo magaca martigeliyaha. Isticmaal dekedda 6514 loogu talagalay TLS. UDP iyo TCP ma sir-qarsana, fariinta UDP-na waxaa la xaqiijiyaa oo keliya in la diray."

#: includes/admin_view.php:278 setup.php:191
msgid "Days"
msgstr "Maalmo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:283
msgid "Timezone"
msgstr "Aagga waqtiga"

#: includes/admin_view.php:291
msgid "Times use the selected timezone and the alarm event time. An end time before the start runs overnight. Equal times cover the entire selected day."
msgstr "Waqtiyadu waxay isticmaalaan aagga waqtiga la doortay iyo waqtiga dhacdada qaylo-dhaanta. Waqti dhammaad ka horreeya bilowga wuxuu socdaa habeenkii oo dhan. Waqtiyo siman waxay daboolaan maalinta la doortay oo dhan."

#: includes/admin_view.php:332 includes/admin_view.php:521
msgid "Create a rule"
msgstr "Samee xeer"

#: includes/admin_view.php:332
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "La hawlgeliyay"

#: includes/admin_view.php:332
msgid "Priority"
msgstr "Muhiimadda"

#: includes/admin_view.php:334
msgid "Rule and destination"
msgstr "Xeerka iyo meesha loo dirayo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:338
msgid "Alarm Destination"
msgstr "Meesha Loo Dirayo Qaylo-dhaanta"

#: includes/admin_view.php:341
msgid "disabled"
msgstr "la joojiyay"

#: includes/admin_view.php:343
msgid "Select one or more alarm destinations. Disabled destinations do not send alarms."
msgstr "Dooro hal ama ka badan meelo qaylo-dhaan loo diro. Meelaha damisan ma diraan qaylo-dhaanno."

#: includes/admin_view.php:345
msgid "Message template"
msgstr "Qaab-dhismeedka fariinta"

#: includes/admin_view.php:345
msgid "Use each destination default, or customize its message for this rule. Customization starts with a copy of the destination template and does not change other rules. If several rules match the same destination, the first matching rule in priority and ID order supplies its template."
msgstr "Isticmaal caadiga meel kasta oo loo diro, ama u habeey fariinteeda xeerkan. Habayntu waxay ka bilaabataa nuqul qaab-dhismeedka meesha loo dirayo mana beddesho xeerarka kale. Haddii dhowr xeer ay u dhigmaan isla meel loo diro, xeerka ugu horreeya ee u dhigma mudnaanta iyo kala horreynta ID ayaa bixiya qaab-dhismeedkiisa."

#: includes/admin_view.php:352
msgid "Custom template"
msgstr "Qaab-dhismeed gaar ah"

#: includes/admin_view.php:355
msgid "Destination recipient"
msgstr "Qaataha meesha loo dirayo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:355
#, php-format
msgid "Recipients: %d"
msgstr "Qaatayaasha: %d"

#: includes/admin_view.php:357
msgid "Customize message for this rule"
msgstr "U habeey fariinta xeerkan"

#: includes/admin_view.php:357
msgid "Unchecked: Use destination default."
msgstr "Aan la calaamadayn: Isticmaal caadiga meesha loo dirayo."

#: includes/admin_view.php:361
msgid "Optional: add each phone number in international format, such as +15551234567. These numbers replace the destination recipient for this rule. Leave the list empty to use the destination default. Each number has its own delivery status and retries."
msgstr "Ikhtiyaari: ku dar lambar kasta oo telefoon qaab caalami ah, sida +15551234567. Lambarradani waxay beddelaan qaataha meesha loo dirayo ee xeerkan. Liiska madhan u daa si aad u isticmaasho caadiga meesha loo dirayo. Lambar kasta wuxuu leeyahay xaaladdiisa gaarsiinta iyo isku-dayada ku-celinta."

#: includes/admin_view.php:374
msgid "None"
msgstr "Midna"

#: includes/admin_view.php:376
msgid "Build device conditions using AND, OR and groups. These conditions use the current Cacti device settings and must also satisfy any alarm filters below. With no device conditions, all devices can match."
msgstr "Ku dhis shuruudaha qalabka adigoo isticmaalaya AND, OR iyo kooxo. Shuruudahani waxay isticmaalaan dejinta qalabka Cacti ee hadda waana inay buuxiyaan shaandhooyinka qaylo-dhaanta ee hoose. Haddii aysan jirin shuruudo qalab, qalabyada oo dhan way u dhigmi karaan."

#: includes/admin_view.php:376
msgid "Match devices"
msgstr "Isku-beeg qalabyada"

#: includes/admin_view.php:387
msgid "Cacti_Admin_Notifications"
msgstr "Cacti_Admin_Notifications"

#: includes/admin_view.php:387
msgid "Device Status"
msgstr "Xaaladda Aaladda"

#: includes/admin_view.php:387
msgid "Syslog"
msgstr "Syslog"

#: includes/admin_view.php:387
msgid "Thold"
msgstr "Thold"

#: includes/admin_view.php:392
msgid "Build alarm conditions using AND, OR, NOT and groups. Alarms must also match the device conditions above."
msgstr "Ku dhis shuruudaha qaylo-dhaanta adigoo isticmaalaya AND, OR, NOT iyo kooxo. Qaylo-dhaannadu waa inay sidoo kale u dhigmaan shuruudaha qalabka ee kor ku xusan."

#: includes/admin_view.php:392
msgid "Match alarms"
msgstr "Isku-beeg qaylo-dhaannada"

#: includes/admin_view.php:395
msgid "No alarm sources detected yet. Sources appear after their first alarm."
msgstr "Weli lama ogaan ilo qaylo-dhaan. Iluhu waxay soo muuqdaan qaylo-dhaantooda ugu horreysa ka dib."

#: includes/admin_view.php:397
msgid "By default, matching alarms can notify at any time. Turn on a schedule to limit when this rule matches."
msgstr "Si caadi ah, qaylo-dhaannada u dhigma waxay ogeysiin karaan wakhti kasta. Daar jadwal si aad u xaddiddo marka xeerkani shaqeeyo."

#: includes/admin_view.php:397
msgid "Notification hours"
msgstr "Saacadaha ogeysiiska"

#: includes/admin_view.php:399
msgid "Suppress notifications"
msgstr "Xakamee ogeysiisyada"

#: includes/admin_view.php:399
msgid "Suppressed alarms remain in history. Recovery notifications bypass acknowledgment, cooldown and duplicate suppression, but still follow notification hours and maintenance windows."
msgstr "Qaylo-dhaannada la xakameeyay waxay ku sii jiraan taariikhda. Ogeysiisyada soo-kabashadu waxay ka gudbaan aqoonsashada, waqtiga qaboojinta iyo xakamaynta nuqullada, laakiin weli waxay raacaan saacadaha ogeysiiska iyo daaqadaha dayactirka."

#: includes/admin_view.php:403
msgid "Set a duration to 0 to turn it off."
msgstr "U deji muddada 0 si aad u damiso."

#: includes/admin_view.php:405
msgid "Rule order"
msgstr "Kala horreynta xeerarka"

#: includes/admin_view.php:408
msgid "Create rule"
msgstr "Samee xeer"

#: includes/admin_view.php:408
msgid "Rules with equal priority run in ID order. Stopping also applies when this rule suppresses notifications."
msgstr "Xeerarka leh mudnaan isku mid ah waxay u shaqeeyaan sida kala horreynta ID. Joojintu sidoo kale waxay khuseysaa marka xeerkani xakameeyo ogeysiisyada."

#: includes/admin_view.php:417
msgid "Configuration Backup/Restore"
msgstr "Kayd-celinta/Soo-celinta Habaynta"

#: includes/admin_view.php:427
msgid "Paused"
msgstr "La hakiyay"

#: includes/admin_view.php:427
msgid "Running"
msgstr "Socda"

#: includes/admin_view.php:428
msgid "everything has been delivered"
msgstr "wax walba waa la gaarsiiyay"

#: includes/admin_view.php:428
#, php-format
msgid "oldest queued %s UTC"
msgstr "kan ugu da'da weyn ee safka ku jira %s UTC"

#: includes/admin_view.php:428
msgid "waiting messages"
msgstr "fariimaha sugaya"

#: includes/admin_view.php:431
msgid "Hide messages"
msgstr "Qari fariimaha"

#: includes/admin_view.php:431
msgid "View messages"
msgstr "Eeg fariimaha"

#: includes/admin_view.php:441
msgid "Endpoint"
msgstr "Barta Dhammaadka"

#: includes/admin_view.php:441
msgid "ID"
msgstr "Aqoonsiga"

#: includes/admin_view.php:441
msgid "Message"
msgstr "Fariin"

#: includes/admin_view.php:441
msgid "Next try"
msgstr "Isku-dayga xiga"

#: includes/admin_view.php:441 includes/reports.php:458
msgid "Queued"
msgstr "Safka ku jira"

#: includes/admin_view.php:441
msgid "Tries"
msgstr "Isku-dayo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:451
msgid "Times in UTC · first 100 shown"
msgstr "Waqtiyada ku jira UTC · 100-ka hore ayaa muuqda"

#: includes/admin_view.php:455
msgid "Pause delivery"
msgstr "Haki gaarsiinta"

#: includes/admin_view.php:455
msgid "Resume delivery"
msgstr "Sii wad gaarsiinta"

#: includes/admin_view.php:458
msgid "Clear queue"
msgstr "Nadiifi safka"

#: includes/admin_view.php:459
#, php-format
msgid "Discard all %d waiting notifications on this poller?"
msgstr "Ma iska tuurtaa dhammaan %d ogeysiisyada sugaya ee ku jira poller-kan?"

#: includes/admin_view.php:460
msgid "Includes retries. They stay in delivery history as failed, reason queue_cleared."
msgstr "Waxaa ku jira isku-dayada ku-celinta. Waxay ku sii jiraan taariikhda gaarsiinta sidii kuwo fashilmay, sababta queue_cleared."

#: includes/admin_view.php:461
msgid "Messages already sending and alarm state are kept."
msgstr "Fariimaha horay u socda iyo xaaladda qaylo-dhaanta waa la hayaa."

#: includes/admin_view.php:462
msgid "Tip: pause delivery first during maintenance."
msgstr "Talo: marka hore haki gaarsiinta inta lagu jiro dayactirka."

#: includes/admin_view.php:463
msgid "Clear queue…"
msgstr "Nadiifinaya safka…"

#: includes/admin_view.php:464
msgid "Controls apply to this poller. While paused, alarms are still received and queued; Resume sends them."
msgstr "Xakamayntani waxay khuseysaa poller-kan. Inta la hakiyay, qaylo-dhaannada weli waa la helaa oo safka ayaa la geliyaa; Sii wad ayaa dirta."

#: includes/admin_view.php:467
msgid "View delivery results"
msgstr "Eeg natiijooyinka gaarsiinta"

#: includes/admin_view.php:470
msgid "Create an integration, configure its destination and credentials, test a sample alarm here, then select it directly in a rule."
msgstr "Samee isdhexgal, habee meesha loo dirayo iyo aqoonsiyada, halkan ku tijaabi qaylo-dhaan tusaale ah, ka dibna si toos ah uga dooro xeer."

#: includes/admin_view.php:476
msgid "Configured integrations"
msgstr "Isdhexgallada la habeeyay"

#: includes/admin_view.php:479
msgid "No integrations yet. Choose a template above to create one."
msgstr "Weli ma jiraan isdhexgallo. Dooro qaab-dhismeed kor ku yaal si aad u sameyso mid."

#: includes/admin_view.php:490
msgid "Alarm Rules"
msgstr "Xeerarka Qaylo-dhaanta"

#: includes/admin_view.php:490
msgid "Choose which alarms should notify, where to send them and when to pause notifications. Rules run from lowest to highest priority."
msgstr "Dooro qaylo-dhaannada ogeysiinaya, meesha loo dirayo iyo marka la hakinayo ogeysiisyada. Xeerarku waxay u shaqeeyaan laga bilaabo mudnaanta ugu hooseysa ilaa tan ugu sarreysa."

#: includes/admin_view.php:493
msgid "Create an integration before saving your first rule."
msgstr "Samee isdhexgal ka hor intaadan kaydin xeerkaaga ugu horreeya."

#: includes/admin_view.php:493
msgid "Create integration"
msgstr "Samee isdhexgal"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Clear"
msgstr "Nadiifi"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Critical"
msgstr "Halis ah"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Information"
msgstr "Macluumaad"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Major"
msgstr "Weyn"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Minor"
msgstr "Yar"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Occurrence"
msgstr "Dhicid"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Raised"
msgstr "La kiciyay"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Recovered"
msgstr "Soo kabtay"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Reminder"
msgstr "Xasuusin"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Updated"
msgstr "La cusboonaysiiyay"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "Digniin"

#: includes/admin_view.php:520
msgid "Alarm notifications require an enabled matching Alarm Rule. Without one, alarms remain in history but no notifications are sent."
msgstr "Ogeysiisyada qaylo-dhaantu waxay u baahan yihiin Xeer Qaylo-dhaan oo shidan oo u dhigma. La'aanteed, qaylo-dhaannadu waxay ku sii jiraan taariikhda laakiin wax ogeysiis ah lama diro."

#: includes/admin_view.php:524
msgid "No rules yet. Create a rule below to start routing alarms to your notification destinations."
msgstr "Weli ma jiraan xeerar. Hoose ka samee xeer si aad u bilowdo jiheynta qaylo-dhaannada meelahaaga ogeysiiska."

#: includes/admin_view.php:533
msgid "Credential values are never loaded into this page. Saving replaces the endpoint record; blank values do not preserve an old password. Use the CLI for protected backup/restore and poller provisioning."
msgstr "Qiimayaasha aqoonsiga marna laguma soo rogo boggan. Kaydintu waxay beddeshaa diiwaanka bar-dhammaadka; qiimayaasha madhan ma ilaaliyaan eray-sir hore. Isticmaal CLI kayd-celinta/soo-celinta la ilaaliyo iyo diyaarinta poller-ka."

#: includes/admin_view.php:536
msgid "Create endpoint"
msgstr "Samee bar-dhammaad"

