#: setup.php:178
msgid "Enter how many days, weeks or months to keep alert history, or choose Indefinitely to keep everything (the number is then ignored). Maximum 3650 days, 520 weeks or 120 months. A purge job runs with the Cacti poller and removes aged events with their decisions, deliveries and attempts. Active conditions and queued or failed work are never purged. Each collector purges its own history."
msgstr "Geli inta maalmood, toddobaadyo ama bilood ee la haynayo taariikhda digniinta, ama dooro Weligeed si wax walba loo hayo (lambarka markaas waa la iska indha tiraa). Ugu badnaan 3650 maalmood, 520 toddobaad ama 120 bilood. Shaqo nadiifin ah ayaa la socota poller-ka Cacti waxayna ka saartaa dhacdooyinka gaboobay iyadoo la socda go'aannadooda, gaarsiintooda iyo isku-dayadooda. Xaaladaha firfircoon iyo shaqada safka ku jirta ama fashilantay marna lama nadiifiyo. Ururiye kasta wuxuu nadiifiyaa taariikhdiisa."

